# Sync for My Workday Planner. Leave everything blank and the planner is purely
# local: no account leaves the device, nothing is uploaded, and the app says so.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Neon — the supported setup
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# On Vercel: Storage -> Create Database -> Neon (region Singapore; the free
# plan has no Indian region). The integration injects DATABASE_URL for you on
# Production, Preview and Development, so there is nothing to copy by hand.
# Then add one variable in all three environments and redeploy:
#
#   VITE_SYNC_MODE=neon
#
# For local development you can fill DATABASE_URL yourself with the pooled
# connection string from Neon -> Connection Details (db/neon-schema.sql is
# applied automatically on first request).
#
# DATABASE_URL is server-side only: api/* reads it, the browser never sees it.
# Do not prefix it with VITE_.
DATABASE_URL=
VITE_SYNC_MODE=
